{# Route reflector rules: a route learned from a CLIENT is reflected to every peer; a route learned from a NON-CLIENT is reflected only to
   clients. Two PEs that are both non-clients therefore never hear each other's routes through the reflector, although each session
   is up and the reflector holds both routes. Changing client status resets the session on IOS, so the clear below is a safety net. #}
router bgp 65000
 address-family vpnv4
{% if rollback %}
  neighbor 10.255.0.1 route-reflector-client
  neighbor 10.255.0.4 route-reflector-client
{% else %}
  no neighbor 10.255.0.1 route-reflector-client
  no neighbor 10.255.0.4 route-reflector-client
{% endif %}
do clear ip bgp vpnv4 unicast * soft
